    "HUSH 是最平静的那只——没有大起大落，也从未病过。它活出了稳定的样子：早睡、冥想、温和地运动。你那段时间正在休长假，它就顺着你的节奏慢慢过完了 21 天。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUSH was the calmest one. No big swings, never sick. It lived in a steady way: early sleep, meditation, gentle movement. You were on a long break then, and it slowly completed 21 days in your rhythm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUSH 是最平静的那只——没有大起大落，也从未病过。它活出了稳定的样子：早睡、冥想、温和地运动。你那段时间正在休长假，它就顺着你的节奏慢慢过完了 21 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kcal" : {

    },
    "kcal · 估算" : {

    },
    "NOCT 只活了 14 天。它从没见过早晨的太阳——你总在凌晨才睡，醒来直接坐到电脑前。它等了很久，你始终没动。慢慢地，它懒得再动。被你熬死的第 3 只。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NOCT lived only 14 days. It never saw the morning sun. You kept sleeping near dawn and waking straight to the computer. It waited for a long time, but you never moved. Slowly, it stopped wanting to move too. The third one lost to your late nights."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NOCT 只活了 14 天。它从没见过早晨的太阳——你总在凌晨才睡，醒来直接坐到电脑前。它等了很久，你始终没动。慢慢地，它懒得再动。被你熬死的第 3 只。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
